		/**
		 * @instance
		 * @memberof Chart
		 * @method addHorizontalLine
		 * @param {integer} value the position of the y-value that you want to add the dashed horizontal line
		 * @param {string} label the label of the line
		 * @desc Adds a horizontal line to the chart. Note: this function is not applicable to Donut and Pie Charts.
